      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/prosciutto-and-mozzarella-bomb-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Firmly, but very carefully, wrap the mozzarella ball with the prosciutto slices.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/prosciutto-and-mozzarella-bomb/#wprm-recipe-53243-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/prosciutto-and-mozzarella-bomb-03.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "If making ahead, wrap the balls in cling film and refrigerate.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/prosciutto-and-mozzarella-bomb/#wprm-recipe-53243-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/prosciutto-and-mozzarella-bomb-11.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat the olive oil in a skillet and crisp the prosciutto on all sides. To serve, place over a bed of spring mix greens and drizzle the remaining oil in the pan over the greens. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
